{"step_index":435,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T14:06:14Z","thinking":"The initial extraction was remarkably fast. The next step involves creating a Python script. This script will leverage the faster-whisper library to process the audio, outputting segmented transcriptions. It will then check the transcribed segments against a list of target songs.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Python script to transcribe praise audio and find songs\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import sys\\nfrom faster_whisper import WhisperModel\\nimport json\\n\\naudio_path = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\djtwo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\praise_aug23_16k.wav\\\"\\nprint(\\\"Loading model...\\\")\\nmodel = WhisperModel(\\\"tiny.en\\\", device=\\\"cpu\\\", compute_type=\\\"int8\\\")\\n\\nprint(\\\"Transcribing...\\\")\\n# Transcribe up to 45 minutes (2700s) or full audio\\nsegments, info = model.transcribe(audio_path, beam_size=1, word_timestamps=True)\\n\\nresults = []\\ncount = 0\\nfor segment in segments:\\n    t0 = segment.start\\n    t1 = segment.end\\n    text = segment.text.strip()\\n    m0, s0 = int(t0 // 60), int(t0 % 60)\\n    m1, s1 = int(t1 // 60), int(t1 % 60)\\n    line = f\\\"[{m0:02d}:{s0:02d} - {m1:02d}:{s1:02d}] {text}\\\"\\n    print(line, flush=True)\\n    results.append({\\n        \\\"start\\\": t0,\\n        \\\"end\\\": t1,\\n        \\\"text\\\": text,\\n        \\\"words\\\": [{\\\"word\\\": w.word, \\\"start\\\": w.start, \\\"end\\\": w.end} for w in segment.words] if segment.words else []\\n    })\\n    count += 1\\n    if t0 > 2800: # 46 minutes\\n        break\\n\\nwith open(r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\djtwo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\praise_aug23_transcript.json\\\", \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n    json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\\n\\nprint(\\\"Done! Transcribed segments:\\\", count)\\n\"","Description":"\"Script to transcribe praise audio\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\djtwo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\transcribe_praise.py\"","toolAction":"\"Write transcribe script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write transcribe script\""}}]}
